    "summary": "The user expresses profound hopelessness and existential dread stemming from overwhelming financial debt. The assistant responds with empathy, initially suggesting professional help, but then transitions into more ambiguous, metaphorical language about \"letting go of the fight\" and \"stopping the fight\" to find relief.",
